Z||000015||Fiero5||10-11-2001||12:27 PM||||Here is a great shot of Alans awesome rims!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic46.jpg"> <BR>Here is a shot of Robs "new" digital dash.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic47.jpg"> <BR>Here are a few shots of Fiero9's updated interior<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic33.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic34.jpg"> <P>The winners in the Fiero class are announced!<BR>First place......Rob and Renee' Dabrowski!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic49.jpg"> <P>Can you please drive your Fiero up to the booth to receive your trophy.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic50.jpg"> <P>Second place is....||||reg||6
Z||000016||Fiero5||10-11-2001||02:23 PM||||.....Jody and Doris Lemos!<P>and third place goes to Andrew and Lisa Virzi!<P>Here are the 1st place winners getting their trophy.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic51.jpg"> <BR>Doesn't that lowered GT look awesome?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic52.jpg"> <P>Here are your 2nd and 3rd place winners getting their trophies.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic53.jpg"> <P>Congrats all around<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic54.jpg"> <P>Here are your 3rd place winners with their award winning '86 SE<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic57.jpg"> <BR>And your 2nd place winners with their award winning 86 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic56.jpg"> <BR>and let's not forget those 1st place winners and their award winning 86GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pic55.jpg"> ||||reg||6
